<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-25599] TcpDiscoverySslTrustedSelfTest is flaky on TC</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-25599</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test testDiscoveryEventsDiscard is &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci2.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=3386094243324005637&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=%3Cdefault%3E&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;flaky on master branch&lt;/a&gt; with failure rate ~ 30%.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failures are reproducible locally.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test fails with an assertion in test code as test TcpDiscoverySpi declares it sees a duplicated messages being sent:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
[ERROR][tcp-disco-msg-worker-[crd]-#49%tcp.TcpDiscoverySelfTest0%-#813%tcp.TcpDiscoverySelfTest0%][TcpDiscoverySelfTest$TestEventDiscardSpi] Send duplicated message: TcpDiscoveryCustomEventMessage [msg=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;super&lt;/span&gt;=TcpDiscoveryAbstractMessage [sndNodeId=ad7215e8-5eb2-4ccc-aa7c-2bf12d500000, id=a9ad4304791-ad7215e8-5eb2-4ccc-aa7c-2bf12d500000, verifierNodeId=ad7215e8-5eb2-4ccc-aa7c-2bf12d500000, topVer=2, pendingIdx=0, failedNodes=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;, isClient=&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;]]
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
